==Battleground==
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
After getting 600% [[:Category:Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], the [[Nimoy Bore]] is not a threat, at least for {{1c}}. [[Seasons of Love (Combo)|Seasons of Love]] and both [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] are good for the normal Bore, and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] are good against Nimoy Bore. If you have [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] by now, he'll absolutely crush Bore, making the stage a cake walk.

